# 'null' and 'any' keep flowing into a bare (unbounded) type parameter; the
# permissive rule is documented in LANGUAGE.md §6.6.  The generic weave is only
# type-checked here, never monomorphized with a scalar.
weave store_ref shard T with x as ref to T into void:
    set essence of x is null

weave main into int:
    return 0
